{n:5,name:"The new Starflare",hours:"~8h",gate:"Name won back + $250,000",into:"Opening night ends the main story",sum:"Gus signs the name over to you; win Vivian's land over Tae, bring in Jalen and Vivian as minority partners, relight the rocket, build the floor and face the license hearing. You own the new Starflare."}
